         "text": "Each term has its own rule: \\( \\frac{d}{dx}\\sin x = \\cos x,\\ \\frac{d}{dx}\\cos x = -\\sin x,\\ \\frac{d}{dx}e^{x} = e^{x},\\ \\frac{d}{dx}\\ln x = \\frac{1}{x} \\), and a constant has derivative 0.",
